WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Standing medium punch is used during Ryu’s corner knockdown.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.450
Back heavy punch hits Ryu as he wakes up.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.350
A second back heavy punch links after the meaty hit.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.850
Medium Renversé converts the two back heavy punches into a throw.

5
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:04.400
Ryu falls after Renversé and the medal count has risen from one to two.
